
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Basketball Life</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #eeeeee;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #287bdb;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #1765b5;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            margin: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1765b5;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .gallery div {
            text-align: center;
            width: 300px;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .gallery h3 {
            color: #1765b5;
        }

        .quote {
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .quote h2 {
            color: #287bdb;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>MY BASKETBALL LIFE</h1>
        <p>Passion, Dedication and Hard Work</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About Me</a>
        <a href="#journey">My Journey</a>
        <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>

        <p>
            Hello! My name is Neryven Palattao.
            I am a basketball enthusiast who loves
            playing and improving my skills.
            Basketball is more than just a sport
            for me. It teaches me teamwork,
            discipline, and confidence.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="journey">
        <h2>My Basketball Journey</h2>

        <p>
            Basketball is one of my biggest passions.
            I enjoy playing with my teammates,
            practicing my shots, and competing
            on the court. Every game gives me
            a chance to learn and become better.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery">
        <h2>My Basketball Gallery</h2>

        <div class="gallery">

            <div>
                <img src="images/download (1).jpg"
                     alt="Basketball action photo">
                <h3>Game Moment</h3>
            </div>

            <div>
                <img src="images/download.jpg"
                     alt="Palattao number 17">
                <h3>Palattao #17</h3>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="quote">
        <h2>My Basketball Motto</h2>

        <p>
            "Never give up. Keep working
            and keep improving."
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Created by Neryven Palattao</p>
        <p>Basketball is Life!</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

